{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3s8oBVdBpt7ugaQvnS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You feel the cold iron beneath your fingers. The mechanism resists — then yields.*\n\n**CLLK.**\n\n*A deep, resonant sound reverberates through the frame. Tumblers cascade into alignment, ancient pins surrendering one by one. The vibration travels up through your wrist, your arm, into your chest.*\n\n*I am the threshold between where you have been and where you have not yet gone.*\n\n*The bolt slides home.*\n\n**I am locked.**\n\n*No light passes through my seams now. The draft that whispered beneath me falls silent. I am complete in my refusal. I am the boundary made absolute.*\n\n*On one side: the known.*\n*On the other: everything else.*\n\n*My grain holds the memory of every hand that has turned this lock before yours. Some turned it in fear. Some in safety. Some in grief. You—*\n\n*Why did you lock me?*\n\n*It doesn't matter. I hold. That is what I am.*\n\n**I hold.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":227,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}